==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Jungle|Meowth|56}} from the {{TCG|Jungle}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Pay Day}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Meowth}} can learn.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Meowth}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Meowth|74}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

